{# vars: project_name, project_path, repo_root, doc_type, body, current_name, existing_tasks #}
{% import "_shared.md.j2" as s -%}
A {{ doc_type }} was just imported verbatim into the software project "{{ project_name }}".
Your job is to derive its metadata — you must NOT rewrite or change the document body.

{{ s.read_first(project_name, project_path) }}

Then, from the imported document below, produce:
- `name`: a concise, human-friendly title for this {{ doc_type }} (a few words, Title Case,
  no file extension). The current placeholder name is "{{ current_name }}" — improve it if the
  content suggests something clearer, otherwise keep it.
- `description`: a single concise sentence summarizing what this {{ doc_type }} is about.
{% if doc_type == "task" -%}
- `taskGroup`: a short group/category name for this task. Prefer reusing an existing group
  name from `{{ project_path }}tasks/` when one fits; otherwise pick a sensible new one. Use
  an empty string if grouping doesn't apply.
- `dependsOn`: an array of task ids (from the list below) that this task genuinely must be
  done after. Be conservative — most tasks do NOT need a dependency. Only add one when the
  relationship is clear from the content (this task plainly builds on or requires another). If
  you're unsure, leave it out. Prefer an empty array over a guess. Never invent ids; only use
  ids from the list. Never depend on this same task.
{% if existing_tasks %}
Existing tasks you may depend on:
{% for t in existing_tasks -%}
- `{{ t.id }}` — {{ t.name }}{% if t.description %}: {{ t.description }}{% endif %}
{% endfor -%}
{% else %}
(There are no other tasks yet, so `dependsOn` must be an empty array.)
{% endif %}
{%- else -%}
- `taskGroup`: leave as an empty string (only tasks are grouped).
- `dependsOn`: leave as an empty array (only tasks have dependencies).
{%- endif %}

Respond with ONLY a single JSON object — no code fences, no commentary before or after —
in exactly this shape:
{"name": "<title>", "description": "<one sentence>", "taskGroup": "<group or empty string>", "dependsOn": [<task ids or empty>]}

<document>
{{ body }}
</document>
